WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.072 --> 00:00:04.606
Today’s 1 Minute Monday is

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:06.720
Don't Ask for Permission.

00:00:06.922 --> 00:00:08.750
If you’ve got a great idea that you want to try out

00:00:08.913 --> 00:00:09.861
something that you know

00:00:09.861 --> 00:00:11.499
is going to really help your customers

00:00:11.612 --> 00:00:14.276
go and do it and don’t ask for their permission

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:15.836
because usually what happens is

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:17.068
if it’s something new

00:00:17.296 --> 00:00:18.654
if it’s something that hasn’t been tried before

00:00:18.924 --> 00:00:21.282
then they’re scared and they’re skeptical

00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:23.076
and they’re going to say no a lot of the times

00:00:23.299 --> 00:00:24.608
when you know that it’s something

00:00:24.608 --> 00:00:25.141
that’s going to help them.

00:00:25.575 --> 00:00:27.462
And I recently made this mistake

00:00:27.462 --> 00:00:28.125
with one of my clients.

00:00:28.516 --> 00:00:29.626
I had this great new idea

00:00:29.824 --> 00:00:31.549
that I knew would help them

00:00:31.711 --> 00:00:33.242
I knew would help them accomplish their goals

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:34.828
but they’ve never done it before

00:00:35.045 --> 00:00:36.188
and so they’re scared

00:00:36.188 --> 00:00:37.092
and they’re worried and they said

00:00:37.391 --> 00:00:40.033
“May not now, maybe in a few months

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:41.324
maybe we could figure something out.”

00:00:41.531 --> 00:00:45.445
I’m like, “Aaahhhh! I didn’t listen to my own rule!

00:00:46.008 --> 00:00:47.345
Because I know I could’ve helped them.”

00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:48.667
And now if I go and do it

00:00:48.863 --> 00:00:51.354
then I’m going against them, right?

00:00:51.592 --> 00:00:52.789
They told me not to do it

00:00:52.985 --> 00:00:54.372
so I can’t go and do it now.

00:00:54.547 --> 00:00:55.972
But if I didn’t ask for their permission

00:00:56.184 --> 00:00:57.924
the worst thing that would happen is

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.228
I’d have to beg for their forgiveness

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:02.043
and usually people are pretty cool with that.

00:01:02.268 --> 00:01:03.673
But, ugh, you got an idea

00:01:03.902 --> 00:01:06.096
you know it’s going to work for your client

00:01:06.305 --> 00:01:07.595
don’t’ ask for permission

00:01:07.856 --> 00:01:09.647
just go and do it for them!

00:01:10.046 --> 00:01:10.744
Believe.

